  <section class="grid min-h-[65svh] place-items-center bg-white px-5 text-center text-black dark:bg-base-950 dark:text-white"><div class="max-w-xl"><span class="mx-auto grid size-12 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#ddff73] text-xl text-black">✓</span><p class="mt-7 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-base-400">Request received</p><h1 class="mt-4 font-sans text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">Thanks. We’ll talk soon.</h1><p class="mt-6 text-base leading-7 text-base-500 dark:text-base-400">I’ll review what you shared and follow up by email about the session, timing, and the questions that matter most to your team.</p><a href="/" class="mt-8 inline-flex min-h-12 items-center bg-black px-6 text-sm font-medium text-white dark:bg-white dark:text-black">Back home →</a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
